## Memory

Predeclared full-pipeline traced peak on Gate-P:

- P7 / direct: **0.7517x**;
- P7 / P6: **0.9220x**;
- P7 / P5: **0.9598x**.

The post-hoc build-only diagnostic gives P7/direct **1.1054x**, P7/P6 **0.8542x**, and P7/P5 **0.9370x** peak allocation. The two arrays help memory relative to P6/P5 build metadata, even though they do not improve construction wall time.

